---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
import AdSlot from '@components/AdSlot.astro';
---

<Layout
  lang="en"
  title="Palworld Boss Guide - All Tower + Field Boss Strategies"
  description="Palworld boss strategies: all 5 Tower bosses (Chillet, Xenolord, Bellanoir, etc.), field bosses, rare bosses. Includes 1.0 + Sakurajima + Feybreak."
>
  <article class="guide-content">
    <header class="page-header">
      <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/en/guides/">Guides</a> › Boss Guide</p>
      <h1>⚔️ Palworld Boss Guide: Towers + Field + DLC</h1>
      <p class="text-secondary">All 5 Towers + Field Bosses + Sakurajima + Feybreak</p>
    </header>

    <AdSlot position="inline" />

    <section>
      <h2>Boss Categories: 5 Types, 5 Different Preparations</h2>
      <p>Palworld has 5 distinct boss categories, each needing different prep:</p>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Tower Bosses (5 towers)</strong>: fixed locations, required for story</li>
        <li><strong>Field Bosses (Alpha Pals)</strong>: random spawns in the wild</li>
        <li><strong>DLC Tower Bosses</strong>: Sakurajima Island + Feybreak Island exclusives</li>
        <li><strong>Rampaging Bosses</strong>: fixed spawn times every day</li>
        <li><strong>Invasion Bosses</strong>: appear when your base is attacked</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <AdSlot position="inline" />

    <section>
      <h2>All 5 Tower Boss Strategies</h2>
      <h3>Tower 1 - Chillet (Fire-Grass)</h3>
      <p>First tower boss, difficulty ★☆☆☆☆. Recommended team: 3 fire Pals at level 20+
        (<a >Foxparks</a> evolutions work great), plus <a >Cattiva</a>
        for attack buff. Tactics: kill the 2 fire adds first, then focus boss. 1.5 minutes max.</p>

      <h3>Tower 2 - <a >Kingpaca</a> (Grass)</h3>
      <p>Second tower, difficulty ★★☆☆☆. Needs <a >Kingpaca</a> at level 25+.
        Key: its Cotton Ball attack slows your team. Bring a fast fire Pal like <a >Blazehowl</a>
        and circle behind for backstabs.</p>

      <h3>Tower 3 - <a >Relaxaurus</a> (Dragon-Water)</h3>
      <p>Third tower boss, difficulty ★★★☆☆. Weak to electric.
        Must bring <a >Grizzbolt</a> at level 30+ - paralyze first, then burst down.
        Bring 30 Mega Spheres to catch it. Caught Relaxaurus is one of the strongest water-dragons mid-game.</p>

      <h3>Tower 4 - <a >Mammorest</a> (Grass)</h3>
      <p>Fourth tower, difficulty ★★★★☆. Needs 50+ dark-type damage.
        Team: <a >Helzephyr</a> + <a href="/en/pals/silvance/">Silveon</a> + <a >Faleris</a>.
        Its earthquake AOE hits everyone - spread Pals out to avoid double damage.</p>

      <h3>Tower 5 - <a >Necromus</a> (Dark)</h3>
      <p>Final tower boss, difficulty ★★★★★. Needs 60+ gear and 70+ Pals.
        Team: <a >Jormuntide</a> + <a >Frostallion</a> + <a >Jetragon</a>.
        Critical: it summons <a >Paladius</a> - kill Paladius first, then Necromus.</p>
    </section>

    <AdSlot position="inline" />

    <section>
      <h2>DLC Bosses: Sakurajima + Feybreak</h2>
      <h3>Sakurajima Tower - <a >Suzaku Aqua</a></h3>
      <p>Sakurajima DLC new tower boss, water-fire dual-type. Bring electric or dark, level 60+.
        Prepare 50 Giga Spheres to try catching it. Caught Suzaku Aqua is the best water-fire hybrid.</p>

      <h3>Feybreak Tower - <a >Xenolord</a></h3>
      <p>Feybreak DLC final boss, dark-dragon dual-type. 70+ gear and 80+ Pals for reliable kill.
        Positioning: its dragon breath is a cone AOE - back up and use single-target damage Pals to burst it.
        Caught Xenolord has the highest HP and attack in the entire game.</p>
    </section>

    <AdSlot position="inline" />

    <section>
      <h2>Field Alpha Boss Quick Farm Table</h2>
      <p>Field bosses spawn in fixed zones, refreshing at 0/6/12/18 every day. The 5 must-farm:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong><a >Penking</a></strong> (starter island): drops 5-8 Ancient Tech Points</li>
        <li><strong><a >Caprity Noct</a></strong> (starter island): rare mats + XP</li>
        <li><strong><a >Elphidran</a></strong> (Sakurajima): electric mats, essential</li>
        <li><strong>Astral Mountain Boss</strong> (Sakurajima): rare metal drops</li>
        <li><strong>Feybreak Boss</strong> (Feybreak): ultimate material source</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <AdSlot position="inline" />

    <section>
      <h2>Universal Boss Prep Checklist</h2>
      <p>No matter which boss you fight, prep this loadout first:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Weapons: <a href="/en/tech-tree/Battle_RangeWeapon_AssaultRifle/">Assault Rifle</a> + <a href="/en/tech-tree/Battle_RangeWeapon_RocketLauncher/">Rocket Launcher</a></li>
        <li>Armor: <a href="/en/tech-tree/Battle_Armor_Grade_04_Steal_Cold/">Pal Metal Armor</a> full set</li>
        <li>Consumables: 50 Mega Spheres + 30 Giga Spheres + 20 healing potions</li>
        <li>Team: 3 DPS Pals + 1 healer Pal + 1 support Pal</li>
        <li>Trap: <a href="/en/tech-tree/Special_SphereFactory_Black_Grade_02/">Megalasphereline Trap</a> for higher catch rate</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="related-links">
      <h2>Use Right Now</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/en/pals/">📖 Paldex (full boss stats)</a></li>
        <li><a href="/en/breeding/">🧮 Breeding Calculator (build boss teams)</a></li>
        <li><a href="/en/guides/tech-tree-guide/">🔬 Tech Tree Priority</a></li>
        <li><a href="/en/guides/beginner-guide/">🎮 Beginner Guide</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .guide-content { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.8; }
  .page-header { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .breadcrumb { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .breadcrumb a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
  h1 { font-size: 2rem; margin: 0.5rem 0; line-height: 1.3; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem; color: var(--accent); border-left: 4px solid var(--accent); padding-left: 0.8rem; }
  h3 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 1.5rem 0 0.5rem; color: var(--text-primary); }
  p { margin: 0.8rem 0; }
  ul, ol { margin: 0.8rem 0; padding-left: 1.5rem; }
  li { margin: 0.5rem 0; }
  a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline; }
  .related-links { margin-top: 3rem; padding: 1.5rem; background: var(--bg-secondary); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); }
  .related-links ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
  .related-links li { padding: 0.3rem 0; }
</style>
